From bc43b00433747d8c8d50cc6d09e636767c9c1162 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chenshuailin <chen.shuailin@intellif.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 09:22:15 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 04/13] port: lora_serve suite (re-port from fork
 lora_serve_and_capturer.patch)

Re-express the fork's LoRA-serve edits onto 692c5f7d (idle-LoRA suite relocated
onto the reworked runner split; obsolete capturer-draft-suppression hunks
dropped; wq_b->indexer collision resolved).

LoRA mechanism (clean/re-anchored):
- lora/utils.py: add V4 leaves to REPLICATED_LINEAR_LORA_NAMES + _KNOWN, and
  wgate/w1/w3/w2 param mappings. wq_b->indexer collision: bare `wq_b` stays the
  V4 *attention* target (NOT remapped to indexer.wq_b); the indexer's own wq_b is
  excluded by the unconditional `.indexer.` skip in lora_manager. Drops upstream's
  indexer-target LoRA for a bare `wq_b` token (V4 never LoRA-trains the indexer).
- lora/lora_manager.py: free_lora_slot on unload; prepare_lora_batch gains an
  explicit use_cuda_graph override; init loop gains the `.indexer.` exclusion,
  the fused wkv_gate n_slices=2 boundary, and the lora_skip_fused_moe FusedMoE
  opt-out.
- lora/{lora,layers,mem_pool,triton_ops/kernel_utils,backend/triton_backend}.py:
  wkv_gate fusion, tp1 replicated wrap + __getattr__ proxy, model-declared
  replicated/skip sizing, masked-load other=0, sgemm validator + tail-fill.
- models/deepseek_v4.py: LoRA leaf declarations (get_hidden_dim/get_stacked_
  multiply/supported_lora_modules), attn-tp>1 + waterfill guards, compressor
  multi-stream LoRA guard, and the missing get_attention_tp_size import.
- models/deepseek_v2.py: shared-expert deepgemm-bypass set_lora guard (hunk a
  only; the is_nextn capture hunk is OBSOLETE and dropped).
- layers/attention/{deepseek_v4_backend,dsv4/compressor}.py, deepep.py,
  tokenizer_control_mixin/tokenizer_manager.py: page-index pins, wkv_gate LoRA
  delta re-anchor, DeepEP topk validator, dp-attention lora-load relaxations,
  abort-path lora_registry release.

Idle-LoRA suite RELOCATED onto the runner split + marked # PORT-GPU-VALIDATE:
- runner/eager_runner.py::_execute_idle (was model_runner.forward_idle prep)
- runner/decode_cuda_graph_runner.py::load_batch (was CudaGraphRunner.replay)
- lora/layers.py x5 idle guards, kernel_utils other=0, triton_backend tail-fill,
  deepseek_v4_backend page-index pins, deepseek_v4 compressor multi-stream guard,
  mem_pool skip, utils.py wq_b remap (14 marker sites total).

OBSOLETE hunks intentionally dropped: topk.py x4 (upstream ships the renamed
capture feature), deepseek_v2 is_nextn kwarg, model_runner graph_runner-rename
accounting.
